---
title: ProximaDB - Write Path End-to-End (2PC TransactionCoordinator + background flush/compaction)
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant API as API Layer (gRPC/REST/pgwire)
    participant Auth as Auth Middleware
    participant Tenant as TenantContext
    participant DML as DmlService
    participant TX as TransactionCoordinator
    participant WAL as WriteAheadLog
    participant Mem as Memtable
    participant Cache as CacheInvalidation

    Client->>API: INSERT / UPSERT request
    API->>Auth: Validate credentials
    Auth-->>API: Authenticated (user_id, roles)
    API->>Tenant: Build TenantContext
    Tenant-->>API: TenantContext {tenant_id, ns_id, tier, billing}
    API->>DML: Write request + TenantContext

    DML->>TX: Begin transaction (TxID)
    TX-->>DML: TxID + snapshot timestamp

    DML->>WAL: append(records, TxID)
    WAL->>WAL: Serialize batch (Proto/Avro/Bincode)
    WAL->>WAL: Write to disk (fsync)
    WAL-->>DML: LSN assigned

    DML->>Mem: Insert into memtable
    Mem->>Mem: Update bloom filter
    Mem-->>DML: Ack

    DML->>TX: PREPARE phase
    TX->>TX: Collect participant votes
    TX-->>DML: All PREPARED

    DML->>TX: COMMIT phase
    TX->>WAL: Write COMMIT {TxID}
    TX-->>DML: Committed

    DML->>Cache: invalidate_query_cache(tenant, coll)
    Cache-->>DML: Cache invalidated

    DML-->>API: WriteResponse {LSN, TxID}
    API-->>Client: Success

    Note over WAL,Mem: Background: FlushCoordinator monitors<br/>memory threshold (512MB) / timer (30s)
    Note over WAL: Background: CompactionCoordinator<br/>merges WAL segments, GC tombstones
